@startuml RAG Pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing false

title DocLingo RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation) Pipeline

|#LightGray|Document Processing|
start
:Load PDF Document;
:Extract Text Pages;
:Chunk Document\n(chunk_size=500, overlap=50);
note right: Creates text chunks\nwith metadata\n(page numbers, positions)

|#LightGray|Embedding Generation|
:Generate Embeddings\nfor all chunks\n(OpenAI text-embedding-3-small);
note right: Converts text chunks\nto vector embeddings\n(dimension: 1536)

|#LightGray|FAISS Indexing|
:Normalize Embeddings\n(for cosine similarity);
:Add to FAISS Index\n(IndexFlatL2);
:Store Chunks + Metadata;
note right: FAISS Index stores:\n- Vector embeddings\n- Text chunks\n- Metadata (page, position)

|#LightGray|Index Ready|
stop

|#LightGray|Query Processing|
start
:User Query Input;
:Generate Query Embedding\n(OpenAI text-embedding-3-small);
note right: Query converted to\nsame vector space\nas document chunks

|#LightGray|Semantic Retrieval|
:Search FAISS Index\n(k nearest neighbors);
:Calculate Similarity Scores\n(L2 distance → similarity);
:Filter by Score Threshold\n(optional);
:Apply Metadata Filters\n(optional);
:Retrieve Top-K Chunks\nwith metadata;
note right: Returns:\n- Chunk text\n- Page numbers\n- Similarity scores\n- Metadata

|#LightGray|Context Preparation|
:Normalize Retrieved Chunks;
:Format Context with Metadata\n(include page citations);
:Build Context String;
note right: Context includes:\n- Retrieved chunks\n- Page references\n- Similarity info

|#LightGray|Answer Generation|
:Build System Prompt\n(language-aware, grounded);
:Build User Prompt\n(query + context);
:Call OpenAI API\n(GPT-4o-mini);
:Generate Answer\n(strictly from context);
note right: LLM generates answer\nusing only provided\ncontext chunks

|#LightGray|Output|
:Return Generated Answer;
stop

@enduml


